>>  This file will be changed and updated as suggestions are incorperated <<
Last update : Tabitha Feb 9 95

Below are our suggestions as to how current cabals can be incorperated and 
connected to the Eternal City.  For specific placements refer to the map of
Eternal Island's geography : /zone/null/eternal/NEW/docs/Map.island
 
**  Listed below are the areas that are either currently up on
the mud, or that we understand will be up in the next few months.

  o  Aeshbourne : Placed on the island, in the forested area.
  o  Africa : Ferry from the wharf. 
  o  Atlantis : Ferry from the wharf.
  o  Bard Castle : Floating on a cloud above the NE part of the Island.  Is
                   reached by a staircase of musical notes.
  o  Castle Drakmoor : Long bridge running west off the Island, through
                       the scrubland.
  o  Crimson City and the Whimsical Garden :  ?
  o  Doom : ?
  o  Easyland : Placed on the island, in the desert area.
  o  Elven Valley :  Wandering elven horse in EC.
  o  Gnomelands :  Placed on the Island, still connected to Easyland.
  o  MoeTown[tm] : Helicopter from the transit port.
  o  Nargolia :  Long bridge running north off the Island, through the desert.
  o  Resort :  Bus from outside the transit port.
  o  Shrine, Entesia, etc : Connected by a tunnel running
                            under the Island's mountains.
  o  Videopolis( Football, Smurfs ) : Staying in EC.
  o  Xmen :  Blackbird at transit port.

** Areas that would actually be on the Eternal Island we have gridded out
in rl to assure a true fit.  

** Please note, these are our *suggestions* only.  We welcome with open paws
your thoughts and opinions, both good and bad.
